    "description": {
      "value": "<h2 data-start=\"4882\" data-end=\"4914\">Level 14 — <strong data-start=\"4896\" data-end=\"4914\">Emotional Lock</strong></h2><p data-start=\"4916\" data-end=\"4938\">You refuse disruption.</p><h3 data-start=\"4940\" data-end=\"4962\">Mechanical Effects</h3><ul data-start=\"4963\" data-end=\"5138\"><li data-start=\"4963\" data-end=\"5005\"><p data-start=\"4965\" data-end=\"5005\">Your Aura <strong data-start=\"4975\" data-end=\"5005\">cannot be forcibly changed</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"5006\" data-end=\"5138\"><p data-start=\"5008\" data-end=\"5069\">As a bonus action, you may <strong data-start=\"5035\" data-end=\"5069\">freeze your current Burn level</strong></p><ul data-start=\"5072\" data-end=\"5138\"><li data-start=\"5072\" data-end=\"5138\"><p data-start=\"5074\" data-end=\"5138\">It cannot increase or decrease until the start of your next turn</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-start=\"5140\" data-end=\"5155\">At <strong data-start=\"5143\" data-end=\"5154\">Burn 3+</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"5156\" data-end=\"5202\"><li data-start=\"5156\" data-end=\"5202\"><p data-start=\"5158\" data-end=\"5202\">You may ignore one backlash trigger entirely</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"5204\" data-end=\"5243\">You choose who you are — and remain so.</p>",
